# Dutch Design form

- Family and chromas come only from locked `design-plan.md`. Inversion pair is near-black / off-white.
- `rounded-none`. Packing grid is invisible. Drawn rules only as named print marks. Hard offset shadow only, never blur.
- Type at 0° or 90°. A sentence at 90° is an object on an inverted field. No CSS 45°. Switcher arrows: `public/arrows/`.
- Expressive pages invert adjacent sections. Quiet stays on one field.
- At least one word- or sentence-as-object per page. Generating rule from the plan — not a chevron quota.
- Hover: inversion or chevron-axis translate. Never `scale-105` or fade-in-up.
- Motion: `--ease-overshoot` on Dumbar/DEPT surfaces and for state feedback. No mixed easings.
- Semantic HTML. No card soup. No identical 3-up feature grids.
